OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby inquiry finds hospital
OL,4,Acould have prevented some deaths, and
OL,5,Arecommends cameras on cots
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deaths of some babies at the
OL,8,Fhospital where killer nurse Lucy Letby
OL,9,Fworked could have been prevented, an
OL,10,Finquiry finds
OL,12,FChair Lady Justice Thirlwall says there
OL,13,Fwas a "complete failure to protect
OL,14,Fbabies" at the Countess of Chester
OL,15,FHospital, with "dysfunctional
OL,16,Fmanagement" and safeguarding practices
OL,17,Fnot followed - key takeaways from the
OL,18,Freport
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
